  m_text: "            how da game WORKS!!!!\n           ----------------------------\nThe
    rules are simple:\nYou have 4 buttons, these buttons are Raise, Check, Call,
    and Fold\n\nRaise increase the size of the current bet\n\nCheck passes the better
    responsibilty\n\nCall matches the current bet made by another player\n\nFold
    kills you instantly at the start of the game, so don't do this if you don't wanna
    lose instantly\n\n"
